## Common-Words Reference

These **common-words** (in kebab-case format) provide context-specific terminology:

| Common-Word | Definition | Context Use |
|----|---|----|
| `planning-folder` | Folder containing planning documentation | Used in plan-mode and dev-mode for referencing |
| `implementation-file` | Planning document with implementation plan | Primary reference during dev-mode |
| `ux-situation` | User interaction scenario | Testing context in dev-mode and direct-mode |
| `implementation-complete` | Signal that implementation is finished | Mode transition signal in all modes |
| `project-rule-parameter` | Referenced Project Rule | Parameter context in commands |
| `research-phase` | Initial discovery phase in direct-mode | First step in direct-mode implementation |
| `direct-implementation` | Implementation without planning docs | Context for implementation in direct-mode |

